35,2,1,talk,Servas,,The minutes show our senior analysts are gone until autumn. That is a gap.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Midori,,"The ledgers show frozen travel costs, but shipping is up. Staffing is thin.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Kenji,,The spectroscopy suite was idle for eleven weeks. That is a major risk.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"The repository is fast now, but breeding colonies cause double the overruns.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"Closeout files show catalogue projects last, while mechanism ones often stall.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Kenji, an idle suite is a disaster for time-sensitive work.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Benjamin, if the biology is the risk, we must be careful.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Servas, yes. The animal facility is better, but the glasshouses are full.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Toshio, that aligns with my findings on schedule slippage.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Midori, the cost shifts are subtle but significant for long-term work.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Servas,,"We have a shortage of hands, but the tools are mostly ready.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Midori,,"The bench fees are subsidized, which helps. But technicians are leaving.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Kenji,,The glasshouse blocks are booked solid. We need to be realistic.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"The computing agreement is free, which is a huge plus for simulation.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Toshio,,The data suggests we should favor projects with lower biological risk.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Servas,,Let us weigh these facts against the candidates.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Midori,,I am leaning towards projects that don't rely on scarce staff.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Kenji,,I worry about the shared instrumentation downtime.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,The repository speed is a game-changer for data-heavy work.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Toshio,,I will trust the historical delivery rates over intuition.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
